WEBVTT

01:40.690 --> 01:44.280
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.120 --> 01:47.320
[Episode 15]

02:09.669 --> 02:10.750
Why are you here?

02:11.460 --> 02:13.310
I was worried, so I came to find you.

02:15.190 --> 02:17.350
What's wrong? You look unhappy.

02:18.079 --> 02:18.960
Are the books not good?

02:23.390 --> 02:24.510
Are you hungry?

02:24.750 --> 02:25.550
No.

02:25.910 --> 02:27.070
You were busy all night yesterday,

02:27.270 --> 02:28.730
and you've been reading all day today.

02:29.060 --> 02:30.150
How could you not be hungry?

02:30.870 --> 02:32.510
Waiter, bring us some roast goose.

02:32.700 --> 02:33.829
Alright, please wait a moment.

02:34.020 --> 02:35.750
I thought they didn't have roast goose here.

02:36.190 --> 02:37.350
I pre-ordered it yesterday.

02:38.270 --> 02:39.150
Thank you.

02:40.510 --> 02:41.430
You're welcome.

02:41.960 --> 02:43.150
You're helping me out too.

02:45.230 --> 02:46.550
Is the creation of the Linglong House

02:46.670 --> 02:48.030
related to "The Book of Calming?"

02:48.370 --> 02:49.329
What?

02:49.860 --> 02:51.350
Not even remotely related.

02:51.950 --> 02:53.030
No connection at all.

02:53.910 --> 02:55.390
Then why did you buy these books?

02:55.750 --> 02:56.590
None of your business.

03:07.310 --> 03:08.460
How come the gambling game

03:08.990 --> 03:10.910
has turned into a music show?

03:11.710 --> 03:12.470
A few days ago, Mei Shan

03:12.470 --> 03:13.940
got some attitude from your master,

03:14.310 --> 03:16.030
and he took it out on those gamblers.

03:16.030 --> 03:17.150
I doubt anyone here

03:17.150 --> 03:17.700
will dare

03:17.700 --> 03:18.829
to gamble again.

03:21.150 --> 03:22.430
Your dishes are all here.

03:22.430 --> 03:23.190
Please enjoy.

03:37.150 --> 03:38.840
Does time really not exist?

03:40.190 --> 03:41.390
Still thinking about that?

03:42.800 --> 03:44.190
Time indeed doesn't exist.

03:44.650 --> 03:46.090
It's just a concept.

03:46.510 --> 03:48.110
If time doesn't exist,

03:48.660 --> 03:50.579
what's the meaning of living?

03:51.230 --> 03:52.630
Although time isn't real,

03:52.950 --> 03:54.710
the chess game we played,

03:54.950 --> 03:55.860
the wine we drank,

03:56.120 --> 03:57.030
and the conversations we had—

03:57.050 --> 03:58.410
they all really happened.

04:00.470 --> 04:01.310
So?

04:02.590 --> 04:03.390
So,

04:03.710 --> 04:05.030
what matters most in life

04:05.250 --> 04:07.200
is the moments and experiences.

04:08.190 --> 04:13.390
♫Lost in the mortal world♫

04:17.550 --> 04:22.390
♫Love and hate come and go♫

04:26.790 --> 04:31.590
♫Drunk in foolish dreams♫

04:35.580 --> 04:39.470
♫Cold or warm, only you will know♫

04:42.230 --> 04:44.790
Those lyrics are quite interesting.

04:45.110 --> 04:46.380
What's interesting about them?

04:48.550 --> 04:49.590
They're about life and death.

04:50.070 --> 04:50.950
Did you not get that?

04:52.430 --> 04:54.030
People of the Youhu Clan

04:54.030 --> 04:55.070
live a very long time.

04:55.620 --> 04:56.870
How can you understand

04:56.870 --> 04:58.110
the life and death of mortals?

04:58.950 --> 05:00.110
Why does that sound

05:00.110 --> 05:01.110
so bitter?

05:01.550 --> 05:02.590
I'm not bitter.

05:04.310 --> 05:06.350
The meaning of life doesn't lie in how long it lasts.

05:06.880 --> 05:08.550
Immortals live for thousands of years,

05:08.990 --> 05:10.990
yet most of them spend their days cultivating in solitude.

05:11.030 --> 05:13.190
Meanwhile, mayflies live for only a day,

05:13.660 --> 05:15.270
but they experience birth, aging, sickness, and death.

05:15.430 --> 05:17.320
They know how to reproduce and sustain life.

05:17.470 --> 05:19.500
They too have their own

05:19.500 --> 05:20.550
love, hate, and heartbreak.

05:20.710 --> 05:22.950
So whether you live for 1,000 years

05:22.990 --> 05:24.270
or just a single day,

05:24.360 --> 05:26.470
what matters most is living the life you want

05:26.560 --> 05:28.070
and feeling content and at ease.

05:29.180 --> 05:30.990
Are you going to say time doesn't exist again?

05:31.630 --> 05:32.630
You're too fixated on it.

05:32.990 --> 05:34.180
As long as you're happy,

05:34.390 --> 05:36.030
why get hung up on the passing of time?

05:37.470 --> 05:38.420
So,

05:38.790 --> 05:39.870
you're not afraid of death?

05:39.870 --> 05:40.510
I am.

05:41.500 --> 05:42.950
But fear won't change anything.

05:43.110 --> 05:44.230
I have to accept it.

05:44.350 --> 05:46.470
Greed has no limits,

05:46.490 --> 05:48.970
so don't obsess over life's length.

05:49.650 --> 05:51.100
Just like that song says,

05:51.630 --> 05:52.710
even if this life

05:52.830 --> 05:54.230
only holds a fleeting moment of joy,

05:54.550 --> 05:55.750
remembering that feeling

05:55.990 --> 05:57.040
is enough.

05:58.030 --> 05:59.790
But the joy in that song

06:00.230 --> 06:01.790
seems to be about romantic love.

06:02.670 --> 06:03.710
Romantic love,

06:03.790 --> 06:04.910
obsessions,

06:05.030 --> 06:06.070
or cravings…

06:06.660 --> 06:07.350
It depends on

06:07.350 --> 06:08.750
each person's understanding of joy.

06:09.310 --> 06:11.310
What if someone gets that joy,

06:12.750 --> 06:15.750
but after experiencing it,

06:16.070 --> 06:17.430
they no longer want to live?

06:18.390 --> 06:19.630
Wouldn't that be a pity?

06:19.870 --> 06:20.800
Then you'll have to ask

06:20.800 --> 06:21.790
that person.

06:22.190 --> 06:23.230
What feels like a pity to you

06:23.860 --> 06:25.670
might not be a pity to them.

06:34.590 --> 06:35.710
I'm heading back.

06:37.390 --> 06:38.190
Sit back.

06:38.550 --> 06:39.470
Finish eating before you leave.

06:39.909 --> 06:41.600
Wasting food is not a good habit.

06:46.750 --> 06:47.830
Why are you back?

06:47.830 --> 06:48.580
I thought you had left

06:48.580 --> 06:49.750
for good.

06:50.630 --> 06:51.390
What?

06:51.390 --> 06:52.230
Why are you afraid of him?

06:52.470 --> 06:53.430
Hey, old man, I'm talking to you.

06:53.430 --> 06:54.230
Can't you hear me?

06:57.630 --> 06:58.430
Master.

07:00.230 --> 07:01.030
You're back.

07:01.150 --> 07:02.950
I have something to ask you.

07:03.230 --> 07:04.040
Wait a moment.

07:04.670 --> 07:05.800
I need to talk to him.

07:10.070 --> 07:10.910
High Priest,

07:12.270 --> 07:14.790
my disciple seems to care a lot about you.

07:16.950 --> 07:17.750
Oh, right.

07:18.070 --> 07:19.070
Since we met,

07:19.270 --> 07:20.710
I haven't given you any gifts.

07:20.950 --> 07:21.740
Gifts?

07:38.270 --> 07:39.430
Yuanzhong, Yuanzhong!

07:48.820 --> 07:49.700
After taking my medicine,

07:49.750 --> 07:50.830
he'll be fine in three to five days.

07:51.360 --> 07:52.310
What a jerk!

07:53.590 --> 07:54.710
He caught Yuanzhong off guard.

07:54.710 --> 07:55.630
So despicable.

07:55.740 --> 07:57.030
I curse him with a miserable death.

07:57.150 --> 07:58.310
Don't say that.

08:00.600 --> 08:01.390
Fine.

08:05.190 --> 08:06.710
Then what should I say?

08:52.670 --> 08:54.710
Master, the tea is ready.

09:05.350 --> 09:06.670
I don't understand.

09:07.190 --> 09:08.670
Why did you hurt Yuanzhong?

09:09.070 --> 09:09.950
You're concerned for him?

09:11.540 --> 09:12.390
I'm not.

09:13.350 --> 09:15.590
I hit him to avenge you.

09:16.310 --> 09:17.110
Avenge me?

09:19.870 --> 09:21.630
60 years ago, during the Battle of Pinghu,

09:21.780 --> 09:22.750
a mysterious girl

09:22.750 --> 09:24.150
appeared on the battlefield.

09:24.220 --> 09:25.450
She was attacked by Yuanzhong

09:25.560 --> 09:27.710
and then sank into the sea

09:27.750 --> 09:29.150
along with Pinghu Xianzhou.

09:29.630 --> 09:30.430
That was you, right?

09:35.260 --> 09:36.550
He hurt you back then,

09:36.620 --> 09:37.870
so he deserved that strike.

09:38.150 --> 09:40.910
Besides, I wanted to test him

09:41.190 --> 09:42.670
to see if he's truly worthy…

09:44.310 --> 09:45.430
of being with you.

09:46.510 --> 09:47.320
After all,

09:47.470 --> 09:48.830
my most beloved disciple

09:48.950 --> 09:50.230
is no longer a mortal.

09:52.310 --> 09:53.430
I'm not as good

09:53.430 --> 09:54.190
as you say, Master.

09:54.750 --> 09:55.780
There are still many things

09:55.780 --> 09:56.790
I don't understand,

09:57.230 --> 09:58.390
and I can't be free of doubts.

10:00.670 --> 10:01.470
Tell me.

10:01.790 --> 10:03.670
What is it that you don't understand?

10:09.550 --> 10:11.270
The four numbers you left behind,

10:11.430 --> 10:12.900
no matter which version I checked,

10:13.110 --> 10:14.310
all point to a line

10:14.310 --> 10:15.110
from "The Book of Calming."

10:15.670 --> 10:16.480
What line?

10:17.270 --> 10:19.910
"Shooting stars shine brilliantly. Even if they burn out, there's no regret."

10:21.110 --> 10:22.750
This line has another meaning:

10:23.430 --> 10:26.470
"If one learns the Way in the morning, one can die without regret by evening."

10:32.550 --> 10:33.350
I knew it.

10:35.150 --> 10:36.280
I couldn't hide it from you.

10:42.310 --> 10:43.110
In this life,

10:43.590 --> 10:44.790
I once prided myself on my craftsmanship.

10:45.870 --> 10:47.310
I believed that no one in this world

10:47.380 --> 10:48.470
could surpass me.

10:50.670 --> 10:51.550
When I met you,

10:52.110 --> 10:53.830
I knew right away you were gifted

10:53.830 --> 10:54.470
and thought you were

10:54.470 --> 10:56.030
the one chosen by heaven to inherit my skills.

10:56.330 --> 10:57.600
I wanted to take you as my disciple

10:58.190 --> 10:59.300
and teach you everything I knew.

11:01.420 --> 11:03.900
But I was too narrow-minded.

11:04.390 --> 11:06.430
You truly were the chosen one,

11:06.590 --> 11:07.590
but what you were meant to inherit

11:08.350 --> 11:09.740
was far greater than my humble craft.

11:10.150 --> 11:10.950
Master…

11:14.900 --> 11:15.830
Seeing you bring

11:15.830 --> 11:16.950
my Linglong House design

11:17.110 --> 11:18.470
to life

11:18.910 --> 11:20.150
and ascend to godhood because of it...

11:22.670 --> 11:23.600
The whole thing

11:24.240 --> 11:25.390
left me feeling down

11:25.390 --> 11:26.390
for quite a while.

11:27.300 --> 11:29.110
I started doubting my path

11:29.950 --> 11:30.790
and all the effort

11:31.090 --> 11:33.010
I had poured into my craftsmanship.

11:36.910 --> 11:37.860
If craftsmanship

11:38.380 --> 11:39.990
was truly my destined path,

11:41.070 --> 11:42.470
then why was it you

11:43.510 --> 11:44.900
who became a god and not me?

11:52.710 --> 11:53.910
For the next few hundred years,

11:54.270 --> 11:55.590
I put aside my craftsmanship,

11:55.940 --> 11:57.390
traveled far and wide,

11:57.530 --> 11:58.610
and turned to swordsmanship instead.

12:00.070 --> 12:01.950
By the grace of heaven, I was gifted

12:02.270 --> 12:03.510
and made some achievements.

12:04.590 --> 12:07.280
But I always felt like

12:08.750 --> 12:09.900
something was missing.

12:13.860 --> 12:14.740
One day,

12:15.070 --> 12:16.350
I stumbled upon a remote village

12:16.900 --> 12:18.110
and saw an old carpenter

12:18.110 --> 12:19.350
making tables and chairs.

12:21.360 --> 12:22.660
He neither knew how to select materials

12:22.990 --> 12:24.270
nor had refined skills.

12:26.230 --> 12:27.470
But I stayed there,

12:29.110 --> 12:30.830
quietly watching him for an entire day.

12:33.510 --> 12:35.270
I watched him slowly turn planks of wood

12:36.430 --> 12:37.990
into tables and chairs.

12:41.630 --> 12:42.910
In that moment, I finally understood

12:43.550 --> 12:46.630
how much I loved craftsmanship.

12:47.790 --> 12:49.750
Cultivation and immortality

12:49.780 --> 12:51.260
meant nothing to me.

12:51.870 --> 12:53.030
Only craftsmanship

12:54.270 --> 12:55.510
could bring me joy.

12:57.590 --> 12:59.510
This kind of joy is small,

13:00.230 --> 13:02.110
and there's no need for others to understand it.

13:02.840 --> 13:03.630
That simple joy

13:03.630 --> 13:04.950
you're talking about,

13:05.230 --> 13:07.510
I've felt it too from time to time.

13:11.230 --> 13:13.150
After that, I returned here,

13:13.230 --> 13:14.990
turned my four unresolved questions

13:14.990 --> 13:16.310
into four seals,

13:16.710 --> 13:17.910
and sealed Yingong Mountain.

13:20.190 --> 13:21.190
I understand now.

13:22.470 --> 13:24.270
What you sealed wasn't just a mountain.

13:24.550 --> 13:25.510
You also sealed

13:25.950 --> 13:27.830
the passion for craftsmanship that you once had

13:27.870 --> 13:29.540
when you first began teaching.

13:29.780 --> 13:31.390
You sealed that chapter of your life

13:31.430 --> 13:32.790
and your mindset back then.

13:35.390 --> 13:37.630
Exactly. That's it.

13:41.790 --> 13:42.790
I knew it.

13:45.470 --> 13:46.910
Only you can understand me.

14:08.870 --> 14:09.990
Now, of the four questions,

14:10.190 --> 14:11.460
you've solved three.

14:11.950 --> 14:13.630
Once you unravel the mystery of the Linglong House,

14:13.830 --> 14:15.350
I'll have no regrets left.

14:17.140 --> 14:19.310
Tanyin, on the last question,

14:20.150 --> 14:21.230
I hope you can enlighten me.

14:22.070 --> 14:23.510
But Master, you haven't become a god.

14:24.070 --> 14:25.910
You've lived for 1,000 years as a mortal

14:26.150 --> 14:27.120
because of

14:27.120 --> 14:28.310
that unwavering obsession.

14:29.590 --> 14:30.550
If I were to

14:30.550 --> 14:31.910
resolve that obsession,

14:32.350 --> 14:33.470
I fear you might

14:33.730 --> 14:35.960
perish in an instant.

14:39.440 --> 14:41.860
"If one learns the Way in the morning, one can die without regret by evening."

14:42.590 --> 14:43.390
If one carries

14:43.390 --> 14:45.150
unanswered doubts in their heart,

14:45.150 --> 14:47.070
life can lose its spark.

14:47.670 --> 14:48.760
You're a craftsman.

14:49.270 --> 14:51.830
Please, fulfill my wish.

14:53.620 --> 14:54.590
Master, don't…

14:57.310 --> 14:59.510
The more capable one is the master.

14:59.930 --> 15:01.720
These four questions are your lessons to me.

15:01.750 --> 15:02.560
So at this moment,

15:04.420 --> 15:05.690
you are my master.

15:09.060 --> 15:10.030
I offer you my respect.

15:22.830 --> 15:23.630
Alright.

15:26.110 --> 15:27.670
I know what you want now.

15:30.790 --> 15:31.670
I'll take

15:34.310 --> 15:35.230
this cup of tea.

15:54.550 --> 15:57.430
Once my master, always my master.

15:58.860 --> 16:00.110
You're my master

16:01.470 --> 16:02.670
and always will be.

16:11.400 --> 16:14.760
♫Racing forward, scars all over my body♫

16:15.150 --> 16:18.060
♫Yet my gaze stays firm and unwavering♫

16:18.330 --> 16:23.280
♫Cutting through this cold, bitter world♫

16:25.230 --> 16:28.430
♫I may be as insignificant as dust♫

16:28.460 --> 16:31.900
♫But I still dare to fight the stars♫

16:32.030 --> 16:37.330
♫With my unyielding soul♫

16:37.950 --> 16:43.000
♫When the world collapses♫

16:43.400 --> 16:50.190
♫I'll draw my sword for you, without a second thought♫

16:51.510 --> 16:56.390
♫Fate is unpredictable like a flickering flame♫

16:56.920 --> 16:59.810
♫I wield love and hate like a blade♫

16:59.840 --> 17:07.390
♫Fearlessly roaming across the world♫

17:19.170 --> 17:22.460
♫What's real? What's fake?♫

17:23.450 --> 17:30.410
♫Good and evil blur together as I race through the mortal world♫

17:32.440 --> 17:35.860
♫Racing forward, scars all over my body♫

17:36.350 --> 17:39.310
♫Yet my gaze stays firm and unwavering♫

17:39.670 --> 17:44.670
♫Cutting through this cold, bitter world♫

17:46.420 --> 17:49.350
♫I may be as insignificant as dust♫

17:49.810 --> 17:52.900
♫But I still dare to fight the stars♫

17:53.150 --> 17:58.530
♫With my unyielding soul♫

17:59.040 --> 18:04.110
♫When the world collapses♫

18:04.570 --> 18:11.280
♫I'll draw my sword for you, without a second thought♫

18:12.040 --> 18:17.370
♫Fate is unpredictable like a flickering flame♫

18:17.590 --> 18:20.660
♫I wield love and hate like a blade♫

18:20.680 --> 18:27.140
♫Fearlessly roaming across the world♫

19:20.820 --> 19:21.900
Brilliant!

19:24.820 --> 19:26.100
That's how it works.

20:51.310 --> 20:52.110
Sir.

20:52.150 --> 20:53.270
Come in and take a break.

20:53.300 --> 20:54.670
Have some freshly steamed pork buns

20:54.670 --> 20:55.150
and a pot of

20:55.150 --> 20:56.590
hot purple bamboo shoot tea.

20:56.590 --> 20:57.510
You'll feel refreshed.

20:58.350 --> 20:59.150
Waiter,

20:59.330 --> 21:01.060
is that Baitou Mountain?

21:01.240 --> 21:02.030
Yes.

21:14.810 --> 21:15.610
Kai Shan.

21:16.900 --> 21:18.240
[Kai Shan, a weapon spirit]

21:17.060 --> 21:17.830
Food.

21:17.870 --> 21:18.710
Where's the food?

21:19.350 --> 21:20.390
The kitchen is over there.

21:23.220 --> 21:24.670
There are some leftovers.

21:26.150 --> 21:27.390
Does he even need to eat?

21:28.470 --> 21:30.310
Other people eat to fill their stomachs,

21:30.790 --> 21:31.870
but Kai Shan?

21:32.270 --> 21:33.670
He eats purely for the pleasure of it.

22:12.200 --> 22:13.060
What's wrong with you?

22:25.350 --> 22:26.790
These dishes smell amazing.

22:27.150 --> 22:28.030
Come on, eat up.

22:28.060 --> 22:28.770
Delicious.

22:30.670 --> 22:31.590
Come and eat.

22:31.590 --> 22:32.630
They'll get cold soon.

22:33.070 --> 22:34.070
You guys go ahead and eat.

22:34.190 --> 22:35.350
I'll go get some wine.

22:35.870 --> 22:36.910
Where's that old man?

22:36.910 --> 22:38.070
Isn't he coming to join us?

22:40.870 --> 22:41.950
No need to wait for him.

22:43.190 --> 22:44.440
Master has passed away.

22:47.060 --> 22:47.870
He's dead?

22:48.470 --> 22:49.760
Master lived for a long time.

22:50.350 --> 22:52.140
The only reason he was still alive

22:52.470 --> 22:53.790
was because in his heart

22:53.790 --> 22:54.910
there were unresolved questions.

22:55.130 --> 22:56.770
Once I solved those four restriction questions,

22:57.150 --> 22:58.550
his wish was fulfilled,

22:58.870 --> 22:59.870
and he left this world.

23:17.030 --> 23:17.910
Are you alright?

23:21.190 --> 23:21.990
I'm fine.

23:24.350 --> 23:26.780
I'm sorry for your loss,

23:27.680 --> 23:29.360
but we all have to die someday.

23:29.820 --> 23:31.500
It's just a matter of time.

23:32.060 --> 23:32.870
So,

23:33.510 --> 23:34.790
don't be too sad.

23:35.950 --> 23:37.030
I'm not sad.

23:38.990 --> 23:40.670
Master was a proud man.

23:41.310 --> 23:42.870
He never cared much about life and death.

23:43.990 --> 23:44.710
He was not able to

23:44.710 --> 23:46.110
ascend to godhood.

23:46.110 --> 23:46.950
But even if he could,

23:48.070 --> 23:49.630
he probably wouldn't have deigned to do so.

23:51.060 --> 23:52.910
A long life without desire or purpose

23:53.470 --> 23:54.470
would've meant

23:54.990 --> 23:57.150
nothing but suffering and loneliness for him.

23:58.630 --> 23:59.430
Are you really okay?

24:01.830 --> 24:03.470
I understand everything,

24:05.590 --> 24:06.630
but it's still

24:06.980 --> 24:08.390
a bit hard for me to accept it.

24:12.350 --> 24:13.150
Yuanzhong.

24:13.910 --> 24:14.710
Yuanzhong.

24:17.590 --> 24:18.390
Yuanzhong.

24:21.070 --> 24:21.870
Yuanzhong.

24:26.390 --> 24:27.190
Congratulations

24:27.710 --> 24:29.190
on breaking the seal on Kai Shan.

24:30.670 --> 24:31.750
It is worth celebrating.

24:32.390 --> 24:33.150
But without you here

24:33.150 --> 24:34.550
haunting me like a ghost,

24:35.030 --> 24:36.390
I would be happier.

24:43.550 --> 24:44.390
What is this?

24:46.110 --> 24:48.020
It's a divine sword forged by the Sword God, Ouye Zi.

24:48.460 --> 24:49.320
It's called the Juque Sword.

24:50.030 --> 24:51.470
So this is the Juque Sword.

24:52.190 --> 24:53.460
Remember when we were kids?

24:53.790 --> 24:54.870
We learned swordsmanship together

24:54.870 --> 24:55.830
under your father's guidance.

24:56.990 --> 24:58.680
He said there was a human master

24:59.310 --> 25:01.120
who ascended to godhood through the art of sword forging.

25:01.870 --> 25:03.710
He forged five swords while in the Mortal Realm,

25:03.990 --> 25:05.670
and the Juque Sword was one of them.

25:05.830 --> 25:07.150
This sword is incredibly sharp

25:07.170 --> 25:08.030
and capable of cutting through

25:08.030 --> 25:09.310
anything in this world.

25:11.270 --> 25:12.670
During the years you were sealed,

25:13.910 --> 25:15.350
I felt guilty for failing you

25:15.790 --> 25:17.390
but didn't know how to save you.

25:17.760 --> 25:19.120
So I wandered among humans,

25:19.390 --> 25:20.430
searching for this sword.

25:21.240 --> 25:23.000
I hoped its unmatched sharpness

25:23.780 --> 25:25.060
could sever your golden hoop.

25:25.960 --> 25:27.430
Unfortunately, after more than a decade,

25:28.050 --> 25:29.100
I still couldn't find it.

25:30.410 --> 25:31.500
It wasn't until a few days ago

25:32.030 --> 25:32.790
that I finally got this sword

25:32.790 --> 25:34.590
from another old friend

25:35.200 --> 25:36.350
whom I had let down.

25:39.230 --> 25:40.580
What exactly are you trying to say?

25:41.510 --> 25:42.670
I want to apologize to you.

25:42.780 --> 25:44.190
You've already apologized.

25:44.830 --> 25:45.830
It's different this time.

25:46.620 --> 25:47.710
When I apologized before,

25:48.430 --> 25:50.190
I was hoping for your forgiveness,

25:50.630 --> 25:52.270
hoping you'd understand my reasons.

25:52.950 --> 25:54.430
But recently, I met someone

25:54.790 --> 25:56.030
who made me realize

25:56.830 --> 25:58.830
that what's done is done.

25:59.390 --> 26:00.590
There's no use in regretting it.

26:01.540 --> 26:02.750
Nor can I change the past.

26:03.630 --> 26:04.990
An apology that demands forgiveness

26:04.990 --> 26:06.350
is not a sincere apology.

26:07.350 --> 26:08.190
I still owe you

26:08.190 --> 26:09.200
a sincere apology.

26:16.070 --> 26:16.870
Yuanzhong.

26:17.430 --> 26:18.950
We grew up together.

26:19.390 --> 26:20.910
I've always seen you as my brother.

26:22.390 --> 26:24.030
When your parents were killed,

26:25.350 --> 26:26.550
I knew the truth,

26:27.630 --> 26:28.750
yet I kept it from you.

26:29.540 --> 26:31.190
Otherwise, you wouldn't have been set up

26:31.950 --> 26:33.310
and imprisoned for decades.

26:34.080 --> 26:35.030
That was my fault.

26:36.440 --> 26:37.680
I failed you.

26:38.580 --> 26:40.050
Whether you forgive me or not,

26:40.710 --> 26:42.510
I'll always see you as my brother,

26:43.110 --> 26:44.010
respect you,

26:44.810 --> 26:45.680
and follow you.

26:48.760 --> 26:49.990
I hope that one day

26:51.540 --> 26:53.270
I can make up for my mistake.

27:09.110 --> 27:10.190
I'll take my leave.

27:13.470 --> 27:14.270
Stop.

27:21.710 --> 27:22.710
Take your sword.

27:24.430 --> 27:25.870
You rambled on and on,

27:26.030 --> 27:27.550
but I still have no idea what you're trying to say.

27:28.270 --> 27:29.630
You're still as chatty

27:29.630 --> 27:30.510
as you were as a kid.

27:34.780 --> 27:36.020
Where are you heading next?

27:36.100 --> 27:36.830
Yandu.

27:38.190 --> 27:38.990
I suspect the War Demons

27:38.990 --> 27:40.390
have received help from the human race.

27:40.960 --> 27:41.620
Otherwise, there's no way

27:41.620 --> 27:42.720
they could've stayed hidden all these years

27:42.790 --> 27:44.110
without us finding a trace.

27:45.110 --> 27:46.470
I'm going to Yandu to investigate.

27:46.630 --> 27:47.950
It's you who found nothing.

27:48.670 --> 27:49.440
I've known for a while

27:49.440 --> 27:50.710
that the War Demons are still alive.

27:51.270 --> 27:53.350
Chiyi and Xiazhi are recovering in Yandu.

27:53.670 --> 27:55.030
You can go find them first.

27:56.790 --> 27:58.070
Chiyi and Xiazhi?

27:59.710 --> 28:01.070
I thought they were dead.

28:01.070 --> 28:01.870
They didn't die.

28:02.430 --> 28:03.820
Zi Fei saved their lives.

28:08.780 --> 28:10.060
Don't look at me like that.

28:10.590 --> 28:11.880
And stop following me around.

28:12.590 --> 28:14.150
Just focus on your own duties.

28:14.430 --> 28:16.350
After all, you're the Commander of the War Division.

28:16.830 --> 28:17.580
If you

28:17.580 --> 28:18.920
let Baili Xiang

28:18.920 --> 28:19.670
take your power so easily again,

28:20.660 --> 28:22.030
don't say you know me.

28:42.780 --> 28:44.060
You sounded so sincere.

28:44.390 --> 28:45.270
I was listening outside the window,

28:45.270 --> 28:46.430
and I nearly fell for it.

28:47.790 --> 28:49.150
I just wanted to get rid of him.

28:49.220 --> 28:50.340
It annoys me

28:50.360 --> 28:51.340
to see him around.

28:51.360 --> 28:52.230
So you were acting?

28:54.750 --> 28:55.630
You asked me to look into

28:55.630 --> 28:57.300
Baitou Mountain. I've got something.

28:58.150 --> 28:59.350
During the Yu dynasty of the human race,

28:59.350 --> 29:00.820
this place was called Yingong Mountain.

29:00.950 --> 29:01.940
But that was

29:01.940 --> 29:03.260
over 1000 years ago.

29:03.310 --> 29:05.150
According to records, Xie You was very famous back then,

29:05.150 --> 29:06.590
which matches what Ji Tanyin said.

29:07.030 --> 29:08.000
He once taught

29:08.000 --> 29:09.710
two highly respected students.

29:09.710 --> 29:11.430
You must have heard of one of them,

29:11.430 --> 29:12.790
though I doubt you can guess who it is.

29:13.230 --> 29:14.030
Who is it?

29:14.340 --> 29:16.470
Goddess Wushuang,

29:16.470 --> 29:17.710
who ascended to godhood a long time ago.

29:18.590 --> 29:20.740
Goddess Wushuang was Xie You's student?

29:21.490 --> 29:23.050
The other one is known as the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain.

29:23.190 --> 29:23.950
Although she hasn't become a god,

29:23.950 --> 29:25.070
she has quite a reputation

29:25.070 --> 29:25.870
among humans.

29:26.950 --> 29:28.150
We go way back with her.

29:28.150 --> 29:29.190
During the Battle of Pinghu,

29:29.190 --> 29:30.390
the girl who took a hit from you

29:30.390 --> 29:31.190
was her.

29:43.220 --> 29:45.100
Ji Tanyin's craftsmanship is impressive too.

29:46.200 --> 29:47.870
Could she be the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain?

29:50.980 --> 29:52.090
It's possible.

29:58.870 --> 29:59.660
Yuanzhong.

30:00.310 --> 30:02.430
All good things must come to an end.

30:03.070 --> 30:03.870
Indeed.

30:03.940 --> 30:04.750
What about you?

30:04.820 --> 30:06.030
What's your plan next?

30:06.470 --> 30:07.470
I've counted the days.

30:07.500 --> 30:08.550
My next tribulation

30:08.550 --> 30:09.410
is coming.

30:09.900 --> 30:11.190
The restriction here is gone.

30:11.220 --> 30:12.860
I need to find another place to face my tribulation.

30:13.110 --> 30:14.270
Otherwise, the whole Baitou Mountain

30:14.270 --> 30:15.710
would be reduced to rubble.

30:16.110 --> 30:16.910
Alright.

30:17.200 --> 30:18.230
Once you've chosen a place,

30:18.350 --> 30:19.750
send your paper messenger to let me know.

30:19.870 --> 30:20.670
Don't worry.

30:21.230 --> 30:22.230
I will.

30:24.110 --> 30:26.200
By the way, Tanghua said

30:26.500 --> 30:27.560
he's waiting for you at the foot of the mountain.

30:27.700 --> 30:28.730
Didn't he leave already?

30:32.250 --> 30:33.850
Where are we going next?

30:58.350 --> 30:59.150
Tanyin.

30:59.830 --> 31:00.630
Tanyin.

31:01.590 --> 31:02.700
It's Hannv.

31:13.430 --> 31:14.430
These are the clues Zi Fei

31:14.430 --> 31:15.470
has collected over the years.

31:15.500 --> 31:17.720
They might help you find

31:17.720 --> 31:18.630
the War Demons.

31:28.070 --> 31:29.710
Just as I suspected.

31:30.110 --> 31:31.070
What are your plans?

31:31.470 --> 31:32.990
I'll first go to Orange Lake

31:33.270 --> 31:34.580
to break Lu Chen's seal.

31:34.990 --> 31:36.150
After that,

31:36.590 --> 31:37.870
I'll also make a trip to Yandu.

31:37.870 --> 31:38.510
Alright.

31:38.590 --> 31:39.670
I'll go there first.

31:39.720 --> 31:40.790
Let's meet in Yandu.

31:43.950 --> 31:44.750
Take care.

31:59.380 --> 32:00.870
What is Ji Tanyin doing over there?

32:01.320 --> 32:02.150
She's been sitting there for ages

32:02.260 --> 32:03.270
without moving a bit.

32:03.510 --> 32:04.540
Does this happen a lot?

32:04.750 --> 32:05.550
Well,

32:05.830 --> 32:07.150
she's just a bookworm,

32:07.390 --> 32:08.670
always off in her own world.

32:08.990 --> 32:10.580
Who knows what she's thinking about?

32:43.110 --> 32:44.070
Hannv.

32:44.430 --> 32:45.990
I wonder why you called me up today.

32:45.990 --> 32:47.110
Is it something important?

32:47.790 --> 32:49.480
Nothing important.

32:50.180 --> 32:51.240
Before you left last time,

32:51.240 --> 32:52.510
you mentioned a dream.

32:52.800 --> 32:54.120
Afterward, Mr. Loong and I

32:54.150 --> 32:55.230
did some analysis,

32:55.510 --> 32:57.070
but we didn't find anything unusual.

32:57.470 --> 32:58.350
During this time,

32:58.350 --> 32:59.870
I dug into all these ancient texts

32:59.950 --> 33:01.430
and dream-related techniques.

33:01.670 --> 33:02.590
The books say

33:02.590 --> 33:04.470
that while most gods' dreams

33:04.470 --> 33:05.870
have prophetic meanings,

33:06.590 --> 33:08.820
it's also possible that they're just

33:08.990 --> 33:10.670
random dreams caused by overthinking.

33:11.540 --> 33:12.340
Really?

33:12.670 --> 33:14.310
You don't need to worry too much.

33:15.310 --> 33:16.710
How have you been lately?

33:16.910 --> 33:18.060
Is everything alright?

33:18.540 --> 33:19.610
Everything's good.

33:19.790 --> 33:20.630
That's good.

33:21.390 --> 33:22.670
You're in the mortal realm

33:22.670 --> 33:23.790
all alone.

33:23.920 --> 33:24.990
If anything happens,

33:25.070 --> 33:27.110
reach out to Mr. Loong or me.

33:27.440 --> 33:28.790
Don't handle everything on your own.

33:29.230 --> 33:30.190
Okay.

33:30.230 --> 33:31.430
Thank you, Hannv.

33:31.670 --> 33:32.470
Oh, by the way,

33:32.870 --> 33:34.430
your birthday is coming up soon, isn't it?

33:36.270 --> 33:37.070
My birthday?

33:38.800 --> 33:39.800
It's still a while away.

33:39.990 --> 33:41.500
I was born in the fall.

33:42.730 --> 33:44.050
I must have remembered it wrong.

33:44.630 --> 33:46.340
I want to make you an embroidery piece

33:46.370 --> 33:47.930
as a birthday gift.

33:48.190 --> 33:49.910
I'll need your birth date and time for that.

33:50.500 --> 33:52.310
Why don't you write them down for me?

33:52.880 --> 33:53.670
Sure.

34:23.020 --> 34:23.830
Kai Shan.

34:24.830 --> 34:26.389
Have you packed enough food for the trip?

34:28.179 --> 34:29.030
It's here.

34:31.730 --> 34:32.690
I'll go get her.

34:32.800 --> 34:33.460
No need.

34:34.190 --> 34:34.909
You two bring the food

34:34.909 --> 34:35.790
onto the carriage.

34:35.790 --> 34:36.670
I'll go get her.

34:46.590 --> 34:47.260
We're leaving.

34:55.480 --> 34:56.270
Ji Tanyin.

35:01.310 --> 35:02.190
When I heard you were back,

35:02.220 --> 35:03.620
I thought you were struck dead

35:03.640 --> 35:04.760
by lightning again.

35:04.990 --> 35:05.800
No.

35:06.000 --> 35:07.200
Hannv called me,

35:07.270 --> 35:08.510
so I came back to check on things.

35:08.710 --> 35:09.760
With all gods in slumber

35:09.760 --> 35:11.270
and you down in the mortal realm,

35:11.270 --> 35:13.570
the Heavenly Realm is eerily quiet!

35:14.020 --> 35:15.150
Isn't Hannv

35:15.150 --> 35:16.150
still here?

35:16.510 --> 35:17.750
She barely

35:17.750 --> 35:19.350
leaves the Luofu Sea.

35:19.350 --> 35:20.710
It doesn't make a difference if she's here or not.

35:20.710 --> 35:21.510
Ji Tanyin.

35:22.470 --> 35:23.270
Ji Tanyin.

35:24.140 --> 35:24.950
Ji Tanyin.

35:25.310 --> 35:26.070
I'm not done talking.

35:26.070 --> 35:26.790
I've got things to do.

35:26.790 --> 35:27.920
I'll come see you another day.

35:33.660 --> 35:34.460
How could she leave

35:35.030 --> 35:36.230
halfway through the conversation?

35:52.950 --> 35:53.750
You're awake.

35:56.780 --> 35:58.220
You didn't leave me behind this time.

35:58.790 --> 36:00.390
Our next stop

36:00.470 --> 36:01.750
is an amazing place.

36:02.300 --> 36:03.290
If you hadn't woken up,

36:04.030 --> 36:05.590
I was gonna bury you there.

36:09.230 --> 36:10.550
What are you reading?

36:14.720 --> 36:15.960
"The Story of the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain."

36:16.400 --> 36:17.280
Have you heard of it?

36:21.150 --> 36:22.710
It's said that the Mute Lady

36:22.990 --> 36:23.990
also once trained

36:23.990 --> 36:25.110
under your master, Xie You.

36:25.350 --> 36:27.550
And she was quite accomplished in craftsmanship.

36:27.990 --> 36:29.390
You and she studied under the same master.

36:29.790 --> 36:31.350
Have you ever heard of her name?

36:32.230 --> 36:32.950
Back when Master

36:32.950 --> 36:33.950
started taking students,

36:33.950 --> 36:35.310
he taught quite a few people.

36:35.470 --> 36:37.700
I was focused on learning and didn't socialize much,

36:38.030 --> 36:39.470
so I didn't get to know everyone.

36:47.120 --> 36:48.600
What do you think of the book?

36:49.310 --> 36:50.500
It's quite interesting.

36:50.670 --> 36:52.510
If everything in it is true,

36:52.590 --> 36:53.430
then this fellow disciple of mine

36:53.430 --> 36:54.780
is really impressive.

37:04.410 --> 37:07.710
[Orange Lake]

37:25.630 --> 37:26.790
Madam, good morning.

37:43.410 --> 37:45.070
[Yunniang, a human]

37:45.750 --> 37:47.070
Mute Goddess of Wu Mountain,

37:47.070 --> 37:48.030
please bless me.

37:48.350 --> 37:49.190
May fortune fall from the sky

37:49.190 --> 37:50.030
while I sit at home.

37:50.030 --> 37:50.870
May rich fools come every day,

37:50.870 --> 37:51.630
generous with their money.

37:51.630 --> 37:52.500
May the poor stay away,

37:52.500 --> 37:53.750
and the ugly not make trouble.

37:57.000 --> 37:57.790
Madam,

37:58.070 --> 37:59.200
you pray to the Mute Goddess every day

37:59.200 --> 38:00.070
for those things,

38:00.430 --> 38:01.830
but maybe taking San and me out

38:01.830 --> 38:03.470
to rob someone could fulfill your wishes faster.

38:04.390 --> 38:05.550
You think I wouldn't if I could?

38:06.560 --> 38:08.160
Last night, I was thinking about it,

38:09.180 --> 38:10.880
and then I saw the Mute Goddess.

38:11.390 --> 38:12.470
No way.

38:14.510 --> 38:15.990
You've never seen her

38:16.040 --> 38:17.480
for your prayers for wealth.

38:18.690 --> 38:19.690
It was in the backyard.

38:20.470 --> 38:21.830
The Mute Goddess chanted a passage

38:21.830 --> 38:23.270
of obscure scripture to me.

38:23.540 --> 38:24.620
She also waved at me.

38:24.710 --> 38:25.830
She had so many arms.

38:25.830 --> 38:26.950
It felt like she could snatch my soul

38:26.950 --> 38:27.870
at any moment.

38:28.820 --> 38:30.390
I was so scared I couldn't sleep all night.

38:31.260 --> 38:32.910
The scripture the Mute Goddess chanted

38:32.910 --> 38:33.950
must've meant something important.

38:34.750 --> 38:35.990
How much do you remember?

38:37.910 --> 38:39.810
Her voice rose and fell,

38:40.350 --> 38:41.470
fading in and out.

38:42.340 --> 38:44.050
I even heard war drums in the background.

38:44.930 --> 38:46.050
I couldn't make out much.

38:46.350 --> 38:47.470
War drums?

38:48.630 --> 38:50.630
Madam, did you drink last night?

38:52.860 --> 38:55.740
Was it at the west corner of the courtyard

38:55.830 --> 38:57.150
where you saw the Mute Goddess?

38:59.000 --> 39:01.080
What? You saw her too?

39:02.730 --> 39:04.410
It was dark and foggy last night.

39:04.430 --> 39:06.390
Are you sure what you saw…

39:08.670 --> 39:09.430
wasn't that wild monkey

39:09.430 --> 39:10.230
that always sneaks in

39:10.230 --> 39:11.510
to steal our food?

39:12.150 --> 39:13.710
I was chopping meat until midnight last night.

39:13.730 --> 39:15.130
That weird chanting

39:15.160 --> 39:16.190
with the sound of war drums

39:16.230 --> 39:17.790
could've been just the wind, right?

39:20.770 --> 39:22.060
Don't you have work to do in the kitchen?

39:22.310 --> 39:23.230
Are you trying to slack off again?

39:23.230 --> 39:24.510
Get out, get out!

39:30.640 --> 39:31.430
Madam,

39:31.470 --> 39:32.790
have some hot water.

39:34.190 --> 39:34.990
Madam,

39:35.230 --> 39:36.310
I've already

39:36.310 --> 39:37.390
flipped all the signs outside.

39:42.220 --> 39:43.860
Stop pretending to be diligent in front of me.

39:44.190 --> 39:45.140
Don't the chickens need to be fed?

39:45.430 --> 39:46.670
Doesn't the vegetable patch need watering?

39:46.670 --> 39:47.430
Get to work!

39:47.990 --> 39:49.070
I'm going right now.

40:05.390 --> 40:06.430
San, Si,

40:06.430 --> 40:07.230
why are we stopping?

40:07.430 --> 40:08.230
Madam,

40:08.460 --> 40:09.600
someone's blocking the way.

40:09.920 --> 40:10.710
Where?

40:26.390 --> 40:27.190
Madam.

40:29.720 --> 40:31.110
That guy still hasn't woken up.

40:31.130 --> 40:32.070
The medicine from the physician

40:32.070 --> 40:33.070
isn't working.

40:38.150 --> 40:40.110
What if he never wakes up?

40:40.190 --> 40:41.740
Are we going to keep taking care of him like this?

40:41.820 --> 40:42.710
When his money runs out,

40:42.710 --> 40:43.800
we'll throw him out.

40:46.790 --> 40:47.630
It's raining.

40:48.760 --> 40:49.670
The vegetables in the yard!

40:49.690 --> 40:50.480
Go bring them in.

40:51.990 --> 40:52.790
Hurry!

41:01.540 --> 41:02.930
Why didn't those two little beggars

41:03.250 --> 41:04.710
show up for food today?

41:35.540 --> 41:37.420
Is something wrong with your neck?

41:38.070 --> 41:38.870
No.

41:39.390 --> 41:40.750
Then you were looking at me.

41:40.770 --> 41:41.580
I was not…

41:44.590 --> 41:45.550
I'll take a rest.

41:45.790 --> 41:46.630
Don't disturb me.

42:00.950 --> 42:01.750
What's wrong with him?

42:03.530 --> 42:04.820
He said he wanted to take a nap.

42:05.020 --> 42:06.460
Where are we going now?

42:07.320 --> 42:08.110
To Eastern Wilderness.

42:08.970 --> 42:09.770
Eastern Wilderness?

42:10.380 --> 42:11.990
What? You've been there before?

42:13.790 --> 42:14.430
But that was

42:14.430 --> 42:15.860
a long time ago.

42:16.030 --> 42:16.870
The most powerful

42:16.870 --> 42:17.990
weapon spirit among us

42:18.030 --> 42:19.180
is sealed there.

42:19.230 --> 42:20.190
Only Kai Shan thinks

42:20.190 --> 42:21.350
he's the most powerful.

42:21.350 --> 42:22.430
Don't take it seriously.

42:23.540 --> 42:25.150
Didn't you used to say the same thing?

42:25.230 --> 42:26.270
That was years ago.

42:26.390 --> 42:27.630
Things might be different now.

42:27.710 --> 42:28.440
I've improved a lot

42:28.440 --> 42:29.630
over the years, after all.

42:29.910 --> 42:31.710
He was just more composed than me

42:31.710 --> 42:32.950
and more efficient in getting things done.

42:33.230 --> 42:34.430
What's his name?

42:35.350 --> 42:36.150
Lu Chen.

42:54.470 --> 42:55.750
What a godforsaken place.

42:56.190 --> 42:57.390
Being sealed here,

42:57.390 --> 42:58.630
Lu Chen must've had it tough.

43:01.710 --> 43:02.510
Someone's coming.

43:04.580 --> 43:05.500
Hello, sir.

43:05.540 --> 43:05.980
Hello.

43:06.000 --> 43:07.960
Are you a local?

43:08.140 --> 43:08.950
Yes.

43:09.070 --> 43:10.630
I'm from Rammed Earth City.

43:09.760 --> 43:10.690
[Bao, a human]

43:11.830 --> 43:13.350
We’re passing through

43:13.350 --> 43:14.230
and hoping to find a place

43:14.230 --> 43:15.270
to stay for the night.

43:15.430 --> 43:16.230
How far is it

43:16.230 --> 43:17.910
to Rammed Earth City from here?

43:19.030 --> 43:20.110
It's quite far.

43:20.150 --> 43:21.620
Go east for about seven miles

43:21.850 --> 43:23.730
and cross a bridge. Then you'll be there.

43:24.880 --> 43:25.870
Thank you.

43:30.030 --> 43:30.910
This old gentleman

43:30.910 --> 43:31.910
is in such good health.

43:31.910 --> 43:32.780
Not everyone at his age

43:32.780 --> 43:34.310
can carry such heavy stuff.

43:40.400 --> 43:41.340
It's getting dark.

43:41.340 --> 43:41.910
Shouldn't we

43:41.910 --> 43:43.190
find a place to stay for the night?

43:45.550 --> 43:46.710
There's a house up ahead.
